{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act5d0_level_act5d0_04_beg",
  "groupId": "act5d0",
  "stageId": "act5d0_04",
  "title": "7:59P.M.",
  "storyCode": "CB-4",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/activities/act5d0/level_act5d0_04_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "15d9ddca700a88230ced503c433fc9cb2cb80aabc7d806c5ebea973e02dea664",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lungmen_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "7:59 P.M. \\ Cloudy\nLungmen Aqueduct, Pier"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stranger",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Now don't go jumping onto any more boats! It's dangerous!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Sorry, it's just, we were..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "By the way, you didn't happen to see a Sankta lady around here, did you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stranger",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I didn't see anything. And I don't have time for this. These sweets are for the after party and are you gonna pay me if they turn up late... Oh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stranger",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "A S- Sankta..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ah! Mostim——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Mostima? You know Mostima?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Sorry. I mistook you for someone else."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(This lady sure looks familiar.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Stranger",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ahem. Anyway, I'll let you off this time. But don't go doing anything that dangerous ever again."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "S- sorry. I didn't mean to trouble you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hm... Forte kid... there was something about a Forte kid... what was it...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Aaah! What are you doing?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You had some candy on your horn."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh, really? I should probably give it back to..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And looking at your horns reminded me of something! They're just like the Mountain Dash Logistics logo!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You're the little prince of MDL, aren't you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Little... prince...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lmstreet_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Sora, ma'am, is this really the way back to Texas and the others?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Relax, I know what Texas is thinking at all times. I can see right into her head."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...her voice has such a familiar quality to it, but I can't put my finger on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "'Ma'am,' huh? Hehe, I never thought the day would come when young Messengers would be calling me that~ So what's your impression of everybody?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Impression?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_pgbase_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_motorway"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lmstreet_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "They're very... um... spirited people."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ahahaha... I can guess what they must've put you through..."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh, sorry!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Child",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Watch where you're going! Ptoo!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That was clearly your fault——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Child",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Who asked you? Mind your own business!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You little brat!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Don't worry about it. Let him go."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But he just swiped your wallet——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hehe, he sure did. But that wallet just had some pumpkin candies inside. See? This is the real one~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You familiar with the old expression 'trick or treat'?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "He was here just to make trouble, and today's not even... why would you have something like that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You may not be able to tell at first glance, but Lungmen's been through a lot lately."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Sauin candles aren't bright enough to light up all the dark corners of this city, and those kids don't exactly have it easy."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But hey, it's just something I came up with. Not bad, huh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What if he grabbed my wallet instead...?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Should be right up ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_park"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Isn't this... the park from before? Did we just make a big circle?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "See? Here they are."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Mmmh! Mmff mff!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Listen, if you don't talk, I'm gonna have to light this fuse."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Yer lips better start flappin', kiddo. These fireworks'll blow ya sky high."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...You forgot to take the tape off his mouth."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh, right. Haha."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——————!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You crazy broads! Do you have any idea who we are?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...the Siracusan Mafia."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Urk, T- Texas...? Don't think we're scared of you!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh we know you're not scared. Why else would you blow up all the boss's collectibles. A bomb in a candy box, though? That's kids' stuff."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...what are you talking about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Huh?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I don't know nothin' about no candy box. But if our capo did up a bomb, you'd all be in pieces—— Mmmf! Mmmh!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This guy sure is full of himself. Let's blast him."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Patience, Exusiai. Let him talk."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*Gasp*——Hah. Ain't you the least bit curious why Lungmen's lettin' us get away with all this?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Not really. As long as we go down to the station once a month to pay our property damage fines, they pretty much let us do whatever too."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Gah..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "C'mon, Exu, let the feller say his piece."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Just look at you broads...!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We got the big man's OK to do whatever we want to Penguin Logistics, right from the real power in Lungmen. You know what that means, don't you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We're a legitimate logistics business? And a pretty good one at that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Then why do we always end up... You know what? Forget it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Who's 'the big man' you're talking about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It sounds really pretentious. Super gross."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Don't play dumb! The Rat King's——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hey! Texas! And the rest!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oh, Sora! What's up~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "How about that. She wrangled Bison too."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hehe, I ran into this lost little calf on my way over, I thought I'd bring him along."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Um... what are you doing? And where's Mr. Emperor?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The boss went somewhere to do something."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You didn't run into anyone else, Sora?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hm? I don't... think... so."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Huh? Do I have something on my face?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "N- no. Anyway, Bison filled me in on the whole story. Where do we go from here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "First we get some more answers from our little buddy, then we formulate an appropriate... response."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Wait, Exusiai, do you mean..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I actually ran into Mostima back there. But then I lost her."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Erm, I mean, after we shook the mobsters, she——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...don't worry about her. That's just how she is. Vanishing years at a time."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...years?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Tell ya the truth, I barely seen heads or tails of her since they hired me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ahaha, let's not get Exusiai too riled up..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This is all very... unorthodox."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "She's a special kind of Messenger."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Contractually, she works for the boss, but more often Laterano has her——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——Exusiai, watch your match."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Huh? Oops."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "MMMMH! MMF——!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Darn it, looks like we're outta time. But that's the way the cookie crumbles."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "MMMMMNG!!!!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Heyo, that sounded like Fronzo! And it didn't sound good!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Let's get over there!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
